  generalInfo: "Ast\u0131m, hava yollar\u0131nda daralma ve a\u015F\u0131r\u0131
    duyarl\u0131l\u0131kla geli\u015Fen kronik bir solunum yolu hastal\u0131\u011F\u0131d\u0131r.
    Hastalarda \xF6ks\xFCr\xFCk, h\u0131r\u0131lt\u0131 ve nefes darl\u0131\u011F\u0131
    g\xF6r\xFClebilir."
  symptomsInfo: "Nefes darl\u0131\u011F\u0131 mevcut olmas\u0131, hafif h\u0131r\u0131lt\u0131,
    kuru \xF6ks\xFCr\xFCk var olmas\u0131 ve ara ara h\u0131r\u0131lt\u0131 ast\u0131mda
    s\u0131k g\xF6r\xFClen belirtilerdendir. Baz\u0131 hastalarda gece artan \xF6ks\xFCr\xFCk
    g\xF6r\xFClebilir."
